<title>UK: First Pacific sets $350 mln 5-yr convertible bond.</title>
<headline>First Pacific sets $350 mln 5-yr convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ING Barings and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FIRST PACIFIC CAPITAL LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  FIRST PACIFIC CO LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $350 MLN	COUPON     *2.0-2.5  MATURITY	 MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  *	   PAY DATE	 =</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    REOFFER    *	   SPREAD     +75-125 BP</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND FIVE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	INDICATED CONVERSION PREMIUM 14.0-18.0 PCT.</p>
<p>		*TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>		NON CALL FOR THREE YEARS, THEN SUBJECT TO 140 PCT</p>
<p>		HURDLE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
